### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3001/api
@authToken = {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

### 1. Consultar análisis vocacional actual del alumno
GET {{baseUrl}}/ai-analysis/current
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 2. Disparar generación de nuevo análisis vocacional con FastAPI
POST {{baseUrl}}/ai-analysis/generate
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
